Error [E0712]: This `#FX` region uses the effect `FS.Read`, which it has no authority for
  --> tests/ui/effects/grant_transitive_is_e0712.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     #FX(authority: IO) {
    |                    ^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `IO`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: #FX
 Scope chain: #FX
